# Versionless on purpose: no version, release date or provider count, so the
# file never needs a bump at release time.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use gup in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "gup — Global Updater"
abstract: >-
  One CLI and full-screen terminal app to scan and update everything installed
  on a machine, across the package managers of Windows, macOS and Linux.
authors:
